 JSON in, JSON out. Routes are listed in `README.md`.

+## Authentication
+
+Send `Authorization: Bearer <key>`. Missing or invalid credentials return
+401 (`unauthorized`). Insufficient permissions return 403 (`forbidden`).
+Viewers can GET, and cooks can also POST to `/recipes/:id/cook`,
+`/batches/:id/waste`, `/temperatures` and `/stocktakes/:id/counts`.
+Managers can use every route.
+
+## Routes
+
+`GET /audit` requires a manager key and returns successful writes newest first.
+Entries contain `time`, `keyName`, `method`, `path` and `status`.
+See the README for the full route list.
+
 ## Errors

 Errors have a status from `src/errors.js` and the body
